{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29890","headline":"回中牡丹爲雨所败二首 一 · 李商隐","name":"回中牡丹爲雨所败二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下苑他年未可追，西州今日忽相期。\n水亭暮雨寒犹在，罗荐春香暖不知。\n舞蝶殷勤收落蘂，佳人惆怅卧遥帷。\n章台街里芳菲伴，且问宫腰损几枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}